WEBVTT

1
00:01:04.023 --> 00:01:05.650
<font color="#D900D9">(BIRDS SQUAWKING)</font>

2
00:01:12.323 --> 00:01:14.576
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> <i>This is Berk...</i>

3
00:01:14.743 --> 00:01:18.830
<i>the best-kept secret this
side of, well, anywhere.</i>

4
00:01:19.748 --> 00:01:22.917
<i>Granted, it may not look like much,
but this wet heap of rock...</i>

5
00:01:23.084 --> 00:01:26.129
<i>packs more than a few surprises.</i>

6
00:01:26.337 --> 00:01:28.173
<font color="#D900D9">(AIR WHOOSHING)</font>

7
00:01:28.381 --> 00:01:30.008
<font color="#D900D9">(BLEATING)</font>

8
00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:35.472
<i>Life here is amazing, just
not for the faint of heart.</i>

9
00:01:35.638 --> 00:01:37.866
<i>You see, where most
folks enjoy hobbies</i>

10
00:01:37.891 --> 00:01:39.851
<i>like whittling or needlepoint...</i>

11
00:01:40.018 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>we Berkians prefer...</i>

12
00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:45.565
<i>a little something
we like to call...</i>

13
00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:49.736
<i>dragon racing!</i>

14
00:01:50.278 --> 00:01:52.113
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE CHEERING)</font>

15
00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.036
Whoo!

16
00:02:00.205 --> 00:02:01.623
<font color="#D900D9">(BLEATS)</font>

17
00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:04.726
<font color="#808080">SNOTLOUT:</font> Whoa! <font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHS)</font>

18
00:02:04.751 --> 00:02:08.146
I'm sorry, Fishlegs.
Did you want that?

19
00:02:08.171 --> 00:02:09.214
Oh! <font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

20
00:02:09.672 --> 00:02:11.883
<font color="#808080">FISHLEGS:</font> Snotlout,
that was mine!

21
00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.259
Here you go, babe.

22
00:02:13.635 --> 00:02:15.011
Did I tell you that you
look amazing today...

23
00:02:15.178 --> 00:02:16.304
because you do.

24
00:02:16.513 --> 00:02:19.224
Ugh. Come on, Barf. It's
starting to stink around here.

25
00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.184
Nope.
Still hates you.

26
00:02:21.351 --> 00:02:23.561
Let's blow this place, Belch!
<font color="#D900D9">(YELLS)</font>

27
00:02:24.145 --> 00:02:25.563
<font color="#808080">TUFFNUT:</font> All right!

28
00:02:27.357 --> 00:02:29.067
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE CHEERING)</font>

29
00:02:31.027 --> 00:02:32.904
<font color="#808080">TUFFNUT:</font> <font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHS)</font>
Oh, yeah!

30
00:02:33.404 --> 00:02:35.990
Ha-ha! That's nine
for the Twins...

31
00:02:36.282 --> 00:02:38.243
Astrid lags with three.

32
00:02:38.409 --> 00:02:42.247
Fishlegs and Snotlout
trail with none.

33
00:02:42.413 --> 00:02:43.873
And Hiccup is...

34
00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:47.252
nowhere to be found.
Hmm.

35
00:02:47.752 --> 00:02:51.381
Scared him off with the big
talk, didn't you, Stoick?

36
00:02:52.882 --> 00:02:54.092
What are you doing, Snotlout?

37
00:02:54.342 --> 00:02:55.635
They're gonna win now.

38
00:02:55.802 --> 00:02:58.179
She's my princess. Whatever
she wants, she gets.

39
00:02:58.346 --> 00:03:01.349
<font color="#808080">ASTRID:</font> Ruffnut? Didn't she
try to bury you alive?

40
00:03:01.516 --> 00:03:02.756
<font color="#808080">SNOTLOUT:</font> Only for a few hours.

41
00:03:05.186 --> 00:03:09.023
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> <i>Now, dragons used to
be a bit of a problem here...</i>

42
00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.483
<i>but that was 5 years ago.</i>

43
00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.585
<i>Now, they have all moved in.</i>

44
00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.821
<i>And really, why wouldn't they?</i>

45
00:03:14.988 --> 00:03:16.781
<i>We have custom stables...</i>

46
00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:18.992
<i>all-you-can-eat
feeding stations...</i>

47
00:03:19.158 --> 00:03:21.494
<i>a full-service
dragon wash...</i>

48
00:03:23.079 --> 00:03:26.833
<i>even top-of-the-line fire
prevention if I do say so myself.</i>

49
00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:29.544
<font color="#D900D9">(CHUCKLES)</font> It's time, Gobber.

50
00:03:29.711 --> 00:03:31.296
Righty-ho.
Last lap!

51
00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.507
<font color="#D900D9">(BLOWING HORN)</font>

52
00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:37.927
The Black Sheep!
Come on, Stormfly.

53
00:03:38.094 --> 00:03:39.904
We can still win this thing!

54
00:03:39.929 --> 00:03:40.930
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL CHEERING)</font>

55
00:03:42.181 --> 00:03:43.821
<font color="#808080">RUFFNUT:</font> Come on, Barf!
<font color="#808080">TUFFNUT:</font> Let's go!

56
00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:45.602
Go, Meatlug!

57
00:03:46.394 --> 00:03:47.620
<font color="#808080">ASTRID:</font> Whoo-hoo!

58
00:03:47.645 --> 00:03:49.439
<font color="#808080">FISHLEGS:</font> Let's go!
Let's go! Let's go!

59
00:03:50.398 --> 00:03:51.858
This is your big moment.

60
00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.943
Have a nice flight!

61
00:03:57.322 --> 00:03:58.323
Up, up, up!

62
00:03:59.782 --> 00:04:01.200
<font color="#D900D9">(BLEATS)</font>

63
00:04:01.951 --> 00:04:03.119
<font color="#808080">ASTRID:</font> No!
<font color="#808080">FISHLEGS:</font> Yes!

64
00:04:03.286 --> 00:04:04.746
Good job, Meatlug.

65
00:04:05.705 --> 00:04:08.124
Here you go, darling.
Mine is worth ten.

66
00:04:08.666 --> 00:04:10.209
Yeah!
The Black Sheep!

67
00:04:11.878 --> 00:04:13.838
<font color="#808080">ASTRID:</font> You guys are
fighting for Ruffnut?

68
00:04:14.005 --> 00:04:15.173
I'm totally winning!

69
00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.467
We're winning
together! <font color="#D900D9">(SCREAMS)</font>

70
00:04:17.926 --> 00:04:18.968
<font color="#808080">SNOTLOUT:</font> Oh, no!

71
00:04:19.427 --> 00:04:21.054
<font color="#D900D9">(CHEERING)</font>

72
00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.139
Whoo! No one can
stop me now!

73
00:04:23.306 --> 00:04:25.808
Except for me. We're
attached, genius.

74
00:04:25.975 --> 00:04:28.478
Quit trying to steal all my glory!
Hey!

75
00:04:29.562 --> 00:04:30.605
Get them, Astrid!

76
00:04:30.813 --> 00:04:31.956
<font color="#808080">TUFFNUT:</font> It's my glory!

77
00:04:31.981 --> 00:04:33.066
<font color="#808080">RUFFNUT:</font> Always
ruining everything!

78
00:04:33.232 --> 00:04:34.312
<font color="#808080">TUFFNUT:</font> No sheep, no glory!

79
00:04:34.317 --> 00:04:36.194
<font color="#808080">ASTRID:</font> Gotcha!
<font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHS)</font>

80
00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.112
Whoa!
Astrid!

81
00:04:38.279 --> 00:04:40.782
Well played! <font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHS)</font> <font color="#D900D9">(SIGHS)</font>

82
00:04:40.907 --> 00:04:43.618
That's my future daughter-in-law!
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

83
00:04:47.622 --> 00:04:49.457
Excuse me.
Stormfly!

84
00:04:49.874 --> 00:04:50.833
Oh!

85
00:04:50.959 --> 00:04:52.439
<font color="#D900D9">(WEAPON CLANGS)</font>
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL EXCLAIM IN SHOCK)</font>

86
00:04:53.461 --> 00:04:55.146
Whoa!

87
00:04:55.171 --> 00:04:56.673
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTING)</font>

88
00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.218
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE CHEERING)</font>

89
00:05:01.886 --> 00:05:05.365
