Oh, what, do you
want an apology?

284
00:08:38.644 --> 00:08:41.647
Is that why you're
pouting, big baby boo?

285
00:08:41.772 --> 00:08:44.692
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUMBLING)</font> Well, try this on!
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

286
00:08:45.484 --> 00:08:47.695
