the people of this world.

2167
01:09:08.437 --> 01:09:10.564
Then why a dragon army?

2168
01:09:10.731 --> 01:09:15.069
Well, you need dragons
to conquer other dragons.

2169
01:09:15.236 --> 01:09:18.781
Or maybe you need dragons
to conquer people.

2170
01:09:18.948 --> 01:09:21.742
To control those
who follow you...

2171
01:09:22.159 --> 01:09:23.911
