2179
01:09:42.346 --> 01:09:43.806
<font color="#D900D9">(SHOUTING)</font>

2180
01:09:49.937 --> 01:09:51.063
What in...

2181
01:09:56.944 --> 01:09:58.112
Hiccup!

2182
01:09:59.029 --> 01:10:00.389
<font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font> <font color="#808080">STOICK:</font> Come on, Gobber!

2183
01:10:00.990 --> 01:10:03.117
Okay, change of plan!

2184
01:10:05.202 --> 01:10:08.664
No dragon can resist
the alpha's command.

2185
01:10:08.831 --> 01:10:12.835
So, he who controls the alpha...

2186
01:10:13.002 --> 01:10:15.546
controls them all.

2187
01:10:19.508 --> 01:10:20.634
Toothless?

2188
01:10:23.137 --> 01:10:24.638
<font color="#D900D9">(WHIMPERS)</font>

2189
01:10:26.348 --> 01:10:28.642
Toothless, you okay, bud?
What's going on?

2190
01:10:28.809 --> 01:10:30.644
<font color="#808080">DRAGO:</font> Witness true strength.

2191
01:10:32.813 --> 01:10:35.900
The strength of
will over others.

2192
01:10:41.196 --> 01:10:42.323
In the face of it...

2193
01:10:43.157 --> 01:10:45.743
you are nothing.

2194
01:10:51.165 --> 01:10:52.583
What did he just tell you?

2195
01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:54.501
<font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font>

2196
01:10:56.378 --> 01:10:58.005
Toothless, come on.

2197
01:10:58.672 --> 01:10:59.752
What's the matter with you?

2198
01:11:00.049 --> 01:11:01.175
No, no, no, no.
Come on.

2199
01:11:01.342 --> 01:11:02.927
What are you doing?
Knock it off.

2200
01:11:03.510 --> 01:11:05.387
Stop! Snap out of it!

2201
01:11:10.059 --> 01:11:11.602
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTING)</font>

2202
01:11:12.853 --> 01:11:13.854
Toothless, no!

2203
01:11:14.438 --> 01:11:15.522
Toothless!

2204
01:11:19.526 --> 01:11:21.070
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> Don't!
Hiccup!

2205
01:11:22.529 --> 01:11:23.572
Stop!

2206
01:11:23.739 --> 01:11:25.699
Son!
Dad!

2207
01:11:25.866 --> 01:11:26.909
No!

2208
01:11:27.701 --> 01:11:29.203
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPING)</font>

2209
01:11:33.749 --> 01:11:35.250
Hmm.

2210
01:11:37.044 --> 01:11:38.545
<font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font>

2211
01:11:46.220 --> 01:11:47.262
No.

2212
01:11:50.808 --> 01:11:52.434
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTING)</font>

2213
01:11:55.562 --> 01:11:56.772
Dad!

2214
01:11:57.731 --> 01:11:58.774
Stoick!

2215
01:12:02.403 --> 01:12:03.404
Dad.

2216
01:12:03.904 --> 01:12:05.906
No, you...

2217
01:12:18.669 --> 01:12:19.670
No.

2218
01:12:28.971 --> 01:12:31.181
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> No, no, no.

2219
01:12:34.935 --> 01:12:36.353
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2220
01:12:53.203 --> 01:12:54.455
No! Get away from him!

2221
01:12:54.997 --> 01:12:56.123
<font color="#D900D9">(WHINES)</font>

2222
01:12:56.331 --> 01:12:57.833
Go on! Get out of here!

2223
01:12:58.500 --> 01:13:00.252
<font color="#D900D9">(WHIMPERS)</font>
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> Get away!

2224
01:13:02.004 --> 01:13:05.632
It's not his fault.
You know that.

2225
01:13:06.508 --> 01:13:07.634
<font color="#D900D9">(SIGHS)</font>

2226
01:13:08.510 --> 01:13:09.762
<font color="#D900D9">(ROARING)</font>

2227
01:13:12.014 --> 01:13:13.323
<font color="#808080">VALKA:</font> <i>Good dragons...</i>

2228
01:13:13.348 --> 01:13:15.476
<i>under the control
of bad people...</i>

2229
01:13:15.642 --> 01:13:16.785
Wait! Don't go.

2230
01:13:16.810 --> 01:13:18.312
<font color="#808080">VALKA:</font> <i>...do bad things.</i>

2231
01:13:21.857 --> 01:13:23.358
<font color="#D900D9">(SNICKERS)</font>

2232
01:13:30.157 --> 01:13:31.617
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

2233
01:13:36.997 --> 01:13:38.373
<font color="#D900D9">(TOOTHLESS WHIMPERS)</font>

2234
01:13:38.499 --> 01:13:39.500
<font color="#808080">DRAGO:</font> Come on!

2235
01:13:41.001 --> 01:13:43.087
Gather the men
and meet me at Berk!

2236
01:13:43.253 --> 01:13:44.713
Toothless!

2237
01:13:44.880 --> 01:13:46.673
No, don't.

2238
01:13:46.840 --> 01:13:48.275
<font color="#D900D9">(MEN CHEERING)</font>

2239
01:13:48.300 --> 01:13:49.593
<font color="#D900D9">(GROWLS)</font>

2240
01:14:12.366 --> 01:14:14.785
<font color="#808080">GOBBER:</font> May the Valkyries
welcome you...

2241
01:14:14.952 --> 01:14:18.539
and lead you through
Odin's great battlefield.

2242
01:14:18.705 --> 01:14:22.042
May they sing your name
with love and fury...

2243
01:14:22.209 --> 01:14:25.254
so that we might hear it rise
from the depths of Valhalla...

2244
01:14:25.420 --> 01:14:28.215
and know that you have taken
your rightful place...

2245
01:14:28.382 --> 01:14:30.425
at the table of kings.

2246
01:14:32.052 --> 01:14:34.555
For a great man has fallen.

2247
01:14:35.806 --> 01:14:38.976
A warrior.
A Chieftain.

2248
01:14:39.143 --> 01:14:40.727
A father.

2249
01:14:41.895 --> 01:14:43.397
A friend.

2250
01:15:17.764 --> 01:15:19.600
I'm sorry, Dad.

2251
01:15:21.435 --> 01:15:22.936
<font color="#D900D9">(SIGHS)</font>

2252
01:15:24.271 --> 01:15:25.564
<font color="#D900D9">(SNIFFLING)</font>

2253
01:15:32.613 --> 01:15:36.325
I'm not the chief
that you wanted me to be.

2254
01:15:36.491 --> 01:15:40.287
And I'm not the peacekeeper
I thought I was.

2255
01:15:41.955 --> 01:15:44.666
I don't know...

2256
01:15:45.459 --> 01:15:46.960
<font color="#D900D9">(SIGHS)</font>

2257
01:15:57.721 --> 01:16:00.307
You came early into this world.

2258
01:16:00.474 --> 01:16:03.143
You were such a wee thing.

2259
01:16:03.310 --> 01:16:06.313
So frail, so fragile.

2260
01:16:06.480 --> 01:16:09.316
I feared you wouldn't make it.

2261
01:16:11.026 --> 01:16:13.153
But your father...

2262
01:16:13.820 --> 01:16:15.364
he never doubted.

2263
01:16:16.657 --> 01:16:17.966
He always said

2264
01:16:17.991 --> 01:16:20.661
you would become
the strongest of them all.

2265
01:16:21.328 --> 01:16:23.247
And he was right.

2266
01:16:24.665 --> 01:16:29.544
You have the heart of a chief
and a soul of a dragon.

2267
01:16:29.711 --> 01:16:31.480
Only you can bring

2268
01:16:31.505 --> 01:16:33.382
our worlds together.

2269
01:16:34.383 --> 01:16:38.387
That is who you are, son.

2270
01:16:52.025 --> 01:16:53.235
I, uh...

2271
01:16:54.361 --> 01:16:57.906
I was so afraid
of becoming my dad.

2272
01:16:59.449 --> 01:17:02.411
Mostly because I
thought I never could.

2273
01:17:02.577 --> 01:17:06.290
How do you become
someone that great?

2274
01:17:06.456 --> 01:17:10.752
That brave?
That selfless?

2275
01:17:13.922 --> 01:17:17.259
I guess you can only try.

2276
01:17:24.057 --> 01:17:27.060
A chief protects his own.

2277
01:17:30.314 --> 01:17:32.065
We are going back.

2278
01:17:33.233 --> 01:17:34.985
Uh, with what?

2279
01:17:35.152 --> 01:17:37.112
He took all the dragons.

2280
01:17:37.487 --> 01:17:39.614
Not all of them.

2281
01:17:43.243 --> 01:17:45.829
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL SCREAMING)</font>

2282
01:17:50.334 --> 01:17:52.169
<font color="#808080">FISHLEGS:</font> I don't want to die!

2283
01:17:52.336 --> 01:17:53.628
We can't fly these things!

2284
01:17:53.795 --> 01:17:55.130
<font color="#808080">FISHLEGS:</font> Yeah, no kidding!

2285
01:17:55.297 --> 01:17:56.898
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font> Whoa!

2286
01:17:56.923 --> 01:17:58.467
<font color="#D900D9">(YELLING)</font>

2287
01:17:58.925 --> 01:18:00.736
But won't that
Bewilderbeast just

2288
01:18:00.761 --> 01:18:02.804
take control of these guys, too?

2289
01:18:02.971 --> 01:18:05.766
They're babies.
They don't listen to anyone.

2290
01:18:05.932 --> 01:18:07.934
Yeah! Just like us!

2291
01:18:08.101 --> 01:18:11.146
This is very dangerous!

2292
01:18:11.271 --> 01:18:12.606
<font color="#D900D9">(GOBBER SCREAMS)</font>

2293
01:18:15.025 --> 01:18:19.029
Some might suggest
this is poorly conceived.

2294
01:18:19.279 --> 01:18:21.281
It's a good thing
that I never listen.

2295
01:18:22.824 --> 01:18:26.453
So what is your plan?

2296
01:18:26.620 --> 01:18:29.790
Get Toothless back
and kick Drago's...

2297
01:18:29.956 --> 01:18:31.041
Heads up!

2298
01:18:31.833 --> 01:18:33.185
And that thing.

2299
01:18:33.210 --> 01:18:34.669
Whoa... Ow!

2300
01:18:39.341 --> 01:18:40.609
<font color="#D900D9">(RUMBLING)</font>

2301
01:18:40.634 --> 01:18:41.968
<font color="#D900D9">(ROARING)</font>

2302
01:18:43.387 --> 01:18:44.721
<font color="#D900D9">(SNORING)</font>

2303
01:18:47.808 --> 01:18:49.059
<font color="#D900D9">(SQUAWKING)</font>

2304
01:18:55.524 --> 01:18:56.650
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2305
01:18:56.858 --> 01:18:58.460
<font color="#D900D9">(EXCLAIMING HAPPILY)</font>
That's a good boy.

2306
01:18:58.485 --> 01:18:59.653
<font color="#D900D9">(COOING)</font>

2307
01:19:04.699 --> 01:19:06.368
<font color="#D900D9">(STAMMERS)</font> Watch the furniture!

2308
01:19:07.494 --> 01:19:09.162
Where are you going?
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2309
01:19:10.831 --> 01:19:12.332
<font color="#D900D9">(PEOPLE SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY)</font>

2310
01:19:20.549 --> 01:19:23.009
<font color="#D900D9">(ROARING)</font>

2311
01:19:23.927 --> 01:19:25.470
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL GASP)</font>

2312
01:19:25.846 --> 01:19:28.849
Your chief is dead.

2313
01:19:29.349 --> 01:19:30.559
Stoick?

2314
01:19:31.518 --> 01:19:34.020
No one can protect you now.

2315
01:19:34.146 --> 01:19:35.772
<font color="#D900D9">(ROARING)</font>

2316
01:19:47.075 --> 01:19:48.076
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2317
01:19:49.244 --> 01:19:50.287
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> No.

2318
01:19:51.079 --> 01:19:52.956
He took all the dragons!

2319
01:19:54.791 --> 01:19:58.770
Distract the alpha. Try to
keep his focus off Toothless.

2320
01:19:58.795 --> 01:20:00.046
Uh... How?

2321
01:20:00.213 --> 01:20:02.048
Have you forgotten
who you're riding with?

2322
01:20:02.215 --> 01:20:05.552
There isn't a dragon alive
that I can't wrangle!

2323
01:20:05.719 --> 01:20:06.862
Except for this one!

2324
01:20:06.887 --> 01:20:08.054
Amateur.

2325
01:20:09.723 --> 01:20:11.057
Hey, look.
It's Hiccup!

2326
01:20:11.308 --> 01:20:13.018
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL CHEERING)</font>

2327
01:20:17.772 --> 01:20:18.773
What?

2328
01:20:28.825 --> 01:20:30.327
<font color="#D900D9">(BLEATING)</font>

2329
01:20:33.163 --> 01:20:34.748
<font color="#808080">RUFFNUT:</font> <font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>
Keep them coming!

2330
01:20:34.915 --> 01:20:36.458
Black sheep, baby!

2331
01:20:36.583 --> 01:20:38.126
<font color="#D900D9">(ROARING)</font>

2332
01:20:45.217 --> 01:20:47.302
<font color="#D900D9">(BLEATING)</font>

2333
01:20:47.594 --> 01:20:48.637
<font color="#808080">SNOTLOUT:</font> Ten points!

2334
01:20:50.347 --> 01:20:52.098
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL LAUGHING)</font>
Oh-oh.

2335
01:20:56.645 --> 01:20:57.646
<font color="#D900D9">(GIGGLING)</font>

2336
01:20:57.771 --> 01:20:58.772
<font color="#D900D9">(GROWLS)</font>

2337
01:20:58.980 --> 01:20:59.981
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2338
01:21:03.026 --> 01:21:04.486
<font color="#808080">FISHLEGS:</font> I'm okay!

2339
01:21:10.825 --> 01:21:12.160
<font color="#D900D9">(EXHALES)</font>

2340
01:21:12.285 --> 01:21:15.580
You certainly are hard to
get rid of, I'll say that.

2341
01:21:15.747 --> 01:21:17.040
Toothless?

2342
01:21:18.375 --> 01:21:19.709
Hey...

2343
01:21:19.876 --> 01:21:21.545
it's me, bud.

2344
01:21:22.128 --> 01:21:23.129
It's me.

2345
01:21:23.380 --> 01:21:25.298
It's me.
I'm right here, bud.

2346
01:21:26.049 --> 01:21:27.609
Come back to me.

2347
01:21:27.634 --> 01:21:29.261
<font color="#D900D9">(DRAGO LAUGHS)</font>

2348
01:21:29.427 --> 01:21:32.097
He's not yours anymore.

2349
01:21:32.264 --> 01:21:34.099
He belongs to the alpha.

2350
01:21:34.266 --> 01:21:37.727
But, please,
great dragon master...

2351
01:21:37.894 --> 01:21:40.230
try to take him.

2352
01:21:40.397 --> 01:21:43.817
He will not miss a second time.

2353
01:21:44.234 --> 01:21:45.986
It wasn't your fault, bud.

2354
01:21:47.571 --> 01:21:49.948
They made you do it.

2355
01:21:59.457 --> 01:22:01.793
You would never hurt him.

2356
01:22:06.089 --> 01:22:08.633
<font color="#D900D9">(DISTORTED)</font>
You would never hurt me.

2357
01:22:09.801 --> 01:22:11.820
<font color="#D900D9">(TOOTHLESS COOING)</font>

2358
01:22:11.845 --> 01:22:13.847
How are you doing that?

2359
01:22:14.014 --> 01:22:15.031
Please.

2360
01:22:15.056 --> 01:22:17.183
You are my best friend, bud.

2361
01:22:18.602 --> 01:22:19.853
<font color="#D900D9">(GROWLING SOFTLY)</font>

2362
01:22:21.438 --> 01:22:23.273
My best friend.

2363
01:22:28.862 --> 01:22:30.530
Atta boy! That's it!

2364
01:22:30.989 --> 01:22:32.007
I'm here!

2365
01:22:32.032 --> 01:22:33.199
<font color="#808080">DRAGO:</font> Enough!

2366
01:22:33.700 --> 01:22:35.035
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

2367
01:22:37.996 --> 01:22:39.039
<font color="#D900D9">(EXCLAIMS)</font>

2368
01:22:39.998 --> 01:22:41.207
Hang on!

2369
01:22:42.042 --> 01:22:43.668
<font color="#D900D9">(DRAGO SCREAMING)</font>

2370
01:22:44.628 --> 01:22:45.854
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

2371
01:22:45.879 --> 01:22:47.047
Almost there, buddy.

2372
01:22:57.641 --> 01:22:59.142
<font color="#808080">DRAGO:</font> Do something!

2373
01:22:59.309 --> 01:23:01.186
We need to get those two apart.

2374
01:23:12.072 --> 01:23:14.240
We have to block
him out, Toothless.

2375
01:23:14.407 --> 01:23:16.409
Do you trust me, bud?
<font color="#D900D9">(RUMBLES)</font>

2376
01:23:18.370 --> 01:23:20.163
We can do this.

2377
01:23:20.747 --> 01:23:22.749
You and me.

2378
01:23:22.916 --> 01:23:24.084
As one.

2379
01:23:26.836 --> 01:23:27.896
That's it.

2380
01:23:27.921 --> 01:23:30.423
Now let's try
this one more time!

2381
01:23:31.091 --> 01:23:32.400
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL CHEERING)</font>

2382
01:23:32.425 --> 01:23:34.219
Take him down, babe!

2383
01:23:37.889 --> 01:23:39.015
Go get them!

2384
01:23:41.434 --> 01:23:42.727
Take control of it!

2385
01:23:45.355 --> 01:23:46.523
Shut it out, Toothless.

2386
01:23:46.690 --> 01:23:48.274
Stop them!
Now!

2387
01:23:52.278 --> 01:23:53.755
<font color="#D900D9">(LAUGHING)</font>

2388
01:23:53.780 --> 01:23:54.781
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2389
01:24:00.120 --> 01:24:01.162
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTING)</font>

2390
01:24:03.039 --> 01:24:04.290
<font color="#D900D9">(SCREAMS)</font>

2391
01:24:06.126 --> 01:24:07.794
<font color="#D900D9">(GROANING)</font>

2392
01:24:11.589 --> 01:24:12.632
Not again.

2393
01:24:14.884 --> 01:24:16.970
Toothless!
It's now or never!

2394
01:24:20.265 --> 01:24:21.599
Come on, bud!
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

2395
01:24:23.476 --> 01:24:24.602
Hold on!

2396
01:24:27.731 --> 01:24:29.482
Yeah! We did it!

2397
01:24:36.156 --> 01:24:37.215
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTS)</font>

2398
01:24:37.240 --> 01:24:38.366
<font color="#D900D9">(SHOUTS)</font>

2399
01:24:38.658 --> 01:24:40.785
<font color="#808080">HICCUP:</font> Hold him there,
Toothless.

2400
01:24:41.077 --> 01:24:42.954
It's all over now.

2401
01:24:44.748 --> 01:24:46.166
Or is it?

2402
01:24:47.876 --> 01:24:48.918
Uh...

2403
01:24:49.502 --> 01:24:50.603
Oh, no!

2404
01:24:50.628 --> 01:24:51.921
<font color="#D900D9">(SCREAMS)</font>

2405
01:24:56.760 --> 01:24:58.178
<font color="#D900D9">(CHUCKLES)</font>

2406
01:24:59.345 --> 01:25:00.346
No!

2407
01:25:02.432 --> 01:25:03.433
No!

2408
01:25:03.767 --> 01:25:05.018
<font color="#D900D9">(GRUNTING)</font>

2409
01:25:11.608 --> 01:25:12.917
Hiccup!

2410
01:25:12.942 --> 01:25:14.169
<font color="#D900D9">(ICE CRACKING)</font>

2411
01:25:14.194 --> 01:25:15.195
<font color="#D900D9">(GASPS)</font>

2412
01:25:21.826 --> 01:25:23.369
<font color="#D900D9">(ALL EXCLAIMING)</font>

2413
01:25:28.374 --> 01:25:30.043
<font color="#D900D9">(ROARING)</font>

2414
01:25:33.213 --> 01:25:34.547
<font color="#D900D9">(PANTING)</font>

2415
01:25:43.848 --> 01:25:45.225
He's challenging the alpha!

2416
01:25:45.391 --> 01:25:47.018
To protect you.

2417
